option.TAA=TAA
option.TAA.comment=Enable Temporal Anti-Aliasing. Smooths jagged edges using frame history.
option.SHARPENING=Sharpness
option.SHARPENING.comment=Enable sharpening filter.
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE.comment=Blackens the edges of the screen.
option.GODRAYS=Godrays
option.GODRAYS.comment=Enable volumetric light rays from the sun.
option.LENS_EFFECTS=Lens Effects
option.LENS_EFFECTS.comment=Enable lens flare and anamorphic lens effects.
option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Enable bloom effect on bright surfaces.
option.SQUARE_SUN_MOON=Square Sun & Moon Glow
option.SQUARE_SUN_MOON.comment=Keep the vanilla square sun and moon shapes but wrap them in a soft glow.
option.WAVING_PLANTS=Waving Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment=Master toggle for all waving plant animations.
option.WAVING_LEAVES=Waving Leaves
option.WAVING_LEAVES.comment=Enable leaves waving animation.
option.WAVING_GRASS=Waving Grass
option.WAVING_GRASS.comment=Enable grass waving animation.
option.WAVING_WHEAT=Waving Wheat
option.WAVING_WHEAT.comment=Enable wheat waving animation.
option.WAVING_FLOWERS=Waving Flowers
option.WAVING_FLOWERS.comment=Enable flowers waving animation.
option.WAVING_FIRE=Waving Fire
option.WAVING_FIRE.comment=Enable fire waving animation.
option.WAVING_LAVA=Waving Lava
option.WAVING_LAVA.comment=Enable lava waving animation.
option.WAVING_LILYPAD=Waving Lilypad
option.WAVING_LILYPAD.comment=Enable lilypad waving animation.
option.SHADOW_QUALITY=Shadow Quality
option.SHADOW_QUALITY.comment=Resolution of the shadow map. Higher = better quality, lower performance.
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.0=Low
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.1=Medium
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.2=High
value.SHADOW_QUALITY.3=Ultra
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=Maximum distance for shadow rendering.
option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Enable water surface wave animation.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS=Water Caustics
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Enable underwater light caustics.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water Reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Enable screen-space reflections on water.
option.RAY_TRACING=Ray Traced GI
option.RAY_TRACING.comment=Screen space path traced global illumination. Bounces light between surfaces. Very expensive.
option.RAY_TRACING_QUALITY=Ray Tracing Quality
option.RAY_TRACING_QUALITY.comment=Rays and march steps per pixel. Higher = cleaner but slower.
value.RAY_TRACING_QUALITY.0=Low
value.RAY_TRACING_QUALITY.1=Medium
value.RAY_TRACING_QUALITY.2=High
option.GI_STRENGTH=GI Strength
option.GI_STRENGTH.comment=Intensity of the bounced (indirect) light.
option.GI_RADIUS=GI Radius
option.GI_RADIUS.comment=How far, in blocks, a ray travels before it gives up. Smaller = faster.
option.COLORED_LIGHTING=Colored Lighting
option.COLORED_LIGHTING.comment=Light sources shine with their own color, and the ray traced global illumination carries that color onto nearby surfaces. Needs ray tracing to spread.
option.COLORED_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Colored Light Strength
option.COLORED_LIGHT_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of the light given off by colored light sources.
option.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL=Low Light Threshold
option.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.comment=Block light levels below this get a brightness lift.
value.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.8.0=8
value.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.10.0=10
value.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.12.0=12
value.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.14.0=14
value.LOW_LIGHT_LEVEL.16.0=16
option.LOW_LIGHT_BOOST=Low Light Boost
option.LOW_LIGHT_BOOST.comment=How much dim block light is brightened. Bright light (torches, lava) is left untouched.
option.PBR=PBR
option.PBR.comment=Physically based shading from a labPBR resource pack: normal maps, specular highlights, reflections and emissive blocks.
option.NORMAL_MAP_STRENGTH=Normal Map Strength
option.NORMAL_MAP_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly the normal map tilts the surface.
option.SPECULAR_STRENGTH=Specular Strength
option.SPECULAR_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of the sun and moon highlights.
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH=Emissive Strength
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH.comment=Brightness of blocks marked emissive in the labPBR specular map.

